 "name_en": "Contract Accounting – Cash Application (47I)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Contract Accounting – Cash Application (47I)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioa11b8005a7a04ad0a5918157630a6ec7\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioa11b8005a7a04ad0a5918157630a6ec7__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">When you transfer your bank statement to payment lots, standard rule-based proposals are generated and the automatic posting and clearing is executed. If you have activated this scope item, the new machine learning service is triggered for payment lot items where the clearing is not successfully completed. This service proposes selection categories and selection values for triggering the clearing control. If you choose to trigger the automatic clearing and the confidence level is above the threshold, the clearing control is automatically processed with consideration to the machine learning proposals.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioa11b8005a7a04ad0a5918157630a6ec7__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Connect to machine learning service and configure machine learning confidence level</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Train your machine learning model</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Run payment lot, send data to machine learning service, and fetch the proposal</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Process the clarifications</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioa11b8005a7a04ad0a5918157630a6ec7__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Automate the clearing of incoming payments to open receivables</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Improve the automatic clearing rate by applying machine learning techniques to the bank statement incoming payment and clearing process</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Reduce manual work and save costs</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>合同会计核算 – 现金应用 (47I)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioa11b8005a7a04ad0a5918157630a6ec7\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioa11b8005a7a04ad0a5918157630a6ec7__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">将银行对账单传输到付款批次时，将生成基于标准规则的建议并执行自动过账和清算。如果已激活此范围项目，则会为未成功完成清算的付款批次项目触发新的机器学习服务。此服务建议用于触发清算控制的选择类别和选择值。如果选择触发自动清算且置信水平高于阈值，则会在考虑机器学习建议的情况下自动处理清算控制。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioa11b8005a7a04ad0a5918157630a6ec7__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">连接到机器学习服务，并配置机器学习置信度</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">训练您的机器学习模型</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">运行付款批次、将数据发送到机器学习服务并获取建议</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">处理澄清</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioa11b8005a7a04ad0a5918157630a6ec7__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">自动清算未清应收账款的收款</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">通过将机器学习技术应用于银行对账单收款和清算流程，提高自动清算率</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">减少手动工作并节省成本</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
